{"id":"629535","name":"核桃壳煮鸡蛋","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629535/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"6个"}],"sub":[{"name":"核桃壳","amount":"6个"},{"name":"分隔木","amount":"6个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"个核桃壳及分隔木用淡盐水洗净。","img":"images/629535/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入煮锅中，加适量清水，浸泡一会儿。","img":"images/629535/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"然后打火煮10分钟，关火。","img":"images/629535/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放至常温。","img":"images/629535/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入洗净的鸡蛋。","img":"images/629535/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放适量盐。","img":"images/629535/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"少许老抽。","img":"images/629535/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开锅煮10分钟。","img":"images/629535/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将鸡蛋皮敲破裂。","img":"images/629535/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"浸泡一个晚上。","img":"images/629535/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629535/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629535/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"1.核桃壳表面凹凸不平，亦藏污纳垢，用淡盐水冲洗干净。\n2.鸡蛋用淡盐水清洗干净。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}